SUMMARY:Golden Belt Arts Invitational OPENING
DESCRIPTION:Durham’s Golden Belt Artist Studios’ Main Gallery is thrilled to show our invited artists to our first annual Golden Belt Invitational. Select works by top local artists are at the Golden Belt Main Gallery through September. The show’s OPENING RECEPTION PARTY is on Durham’s Third Friday Art Walk & Gallery Crawl (Friday September 18). Invited artists include: Alia El-Bermani\, Kiki Farish\, Fabrizio Bianchi\, Christy LaGuardia \, Dan Chaffee\, Nancy Sampson and Lynda Stuart Curry. 6 to 9pm – Friday September 18. 800 Taylor Street\, Durham\, NC 27701 (around the corner from Hi-Wire Brewing).
