SUMMARY:Flux & Drift 06: Crown Jewels @ Future Hooman
DESCRIPTION:Our Flux & Drift party series at Future Hooman is back in September during the Downtown Durham 3rd Friday Art Walk! This month\, we’re getting a little… ~regal~ \n👑 CROWN JEWELS 👑\n– Enjoy Sparkly Sounds & Royal Ambience\n– Wander Our Palace of Strange & Shiny Things\n– Mingle with Curious Beautiful Nobility\n– Graze on Royal Snacks & Precious Libations\n– Experience a Mysterious Collaborative Art Ritual \nCome ready to have fun\, connect with other creative folks\, and discover your inner royalty. \nParticipation in play is always optional\, but we’re asking everyone to help set the atmosphere by wearing a crown\, sparkly frock\, or other suitably regal attire. Make one\, bring one\, or borrow one of ours\, which will look strikingly similar to a Burger King cardboard crown (YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED). \nNeed some inspo? Aim for “I Have Questionable Authority” 💎 or peruse our mood board: https://pin.it/4AsCNUAto
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/flux-drift-06-crown-jewels-future-hooman/
LOCATION:Future Hooman\, 109 W Orange St\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Art,Author / Artist Visit,Costumes,Mixers and Parties,Third Friday
