SUMMARY:Out of Frame: 16mm Film Event
DESCRIPTION:Unexposed presents Out of Frame\, a guerrilla film screening series returning September 18 for Third Friday Durham! Various short 16mm experimental films will be projected off the back of a yellow Kei truck on Parrish Street from 8-9pm. Popcorn machine on site! \nPresented by Unexposed\, a roaming microcinema facilitating the growth of experimental and avant-garde film in the Triangle\, NC.
