SUMMARY:Todd Barry: Extend All Courtesies Tour
DESCRIPTION:Comedian Todd Barry returns to Durham with the Extend All Courtesies Tour!\nTodd has released four one-hour stand-up specials including his latest one\, Domestic Shorthair. He’s appeared on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, The Late Show with David Letterman\, Conan and Late Night with Seth Meyers. His acting credits include the feature films The Wrestler and Road Trip. He has also starred in several television series such as Flight of the Concords\, Chappelle’s Show\, Spin City\, Sex and the City and many more. You may have heard his voice on the animated series Bob’s Burgers\, Dr. Katz\, Professional Therapist\, and Aqua Teen Hunger Force. Todd is also the author of the critically-acclaimed 2017 travel memoir Thank You For Coming To Hattiesburg.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/todd-barry-extend-all-courtesies-tour/
