SUMMARY:NURTURE & FLOW: A YOGA AND SOUNDBATH EXPERIENCE
DESCRIPTION:For the ones who nurture everyone else\, this space is for you!! \nGive yourself the gift of rest\, care\, and connection. Nurture & Flow is a 90-minute experience designed to create space for you to slow down\, reconnect with yourself\, and receive some of the care you so often give to others. \nWe’ll begin with 45 minutes of gentle and restorative all-levels yoga\, guiding you to release tension\, reconnect with your body\, and soften into the present moment. Then\, sink into 45 minutes of a restorative sound bath\, allowing the healing vibrations to support deep relaxation and nervous system reset. \nThroughout the experience\, you’ll be invited to: \nMove with intention and ease. \nExplore breathwork and mindful stillness. \nRest fully as sound vibrations wash over you\, bringing calm and renewal. \nTake this time to receive the care you give to others\, nurture yourself\, and create space to simply be. No experience is needed. Just bring your presence and your willingness to relax. \nInvestment:\n$50 – Individual Admission \nLocation: \nThe 360 Approach: 404 Hunt St #135\, Durham\, NC 27701 \nWhat to Bring: \nYoga mat and/or blanket (highly recommended) \nWater or tea \nAny props that support your comfort (pillows\, journal\, eye mask\, blocks\, bolsters\, straps\, etc.)
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/nurture-flow-a-yoga-and-soundbath-experience/
LOCATION:The 360° Approach\, 404 Hunt St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,Classes & Workshops,Fitness,Health,Pop-Up
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/nurtureflowpt2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Flowtious Soul Yoga":MAILTO:flowtious.soul.yoga@gmail.com
GEO:36.0003557;-78.9030525
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The 360° Approach 404 Hunt St. Durham NC 27701 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=404 Hunt St.:geo:-78.9030525,36.0003557
END:VEVENT
