DESCRIPTION:Inkfinity Printing will be hosting local 919 small businesses and creators for a fun event. \n-Come enjoy beverages from Trophy Brewing!\n-Check out local businesses and creators !\n-BYOT (bring your own shirt) or buy a blank from us and get a custom live screen printed shirt!\n-Create your own custom hat with live embroidery!\n-Hangout in the shop and Support Small! \nVendors:\nPapermill Creative\nBadcat\nLazylamb Art\nChelsea Rose\nSchrader Art\nNappysim Art\nManifest skateshop\nWelcome Tattoo\nRecess Yoga\nPsychic hotline\n+ More \nLocated at 601 Foster St … backside basement / garage street side door will be open also. Come browse and hangout from 11-5pm // 9.19.26 \nWe are stoked to see everyone there!
