SUMMARY:Zoomies: Stories & Sketch Comedy About People and their Pets
DESCRIPTION:A one-hour comedy extravaganza celebrating the pets who rule our lives. We salute you\, obedience school dropout. We respect you\, feline trying to stop me from typing this sentence kjhfdsiuokwer. \nFeaturing storytellers and sketch comedy from Mettlesome writers and performers. This show is dedicated to the memory of Dr. Jenny Bennett\, founding veterinarian of Mettlesome’s stalwart neighbor\, Urban Tails Veterinary Hospital. and is a fundraiser for the Urban Tails Compassion Fund. \nProduced and Directed by Nina Martin and Alissa Martucci \nWritten and Performed by Alissa Martucci\, Colin Ryan\, Cooper Thornton\, Eden Yaacobi\, Emily Armond\, Kevin Petersen\, Marc Anthony Figueras\, Melissa Kaye\, Nathan Gyori\, Nina Martin\, Sierra Smith\, Stephen Shepard\, Trish Fox\, and Zannie Gunn \nTechnical design by Cary LaMay.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/zoomies-stories-sketch-comedy-about-people-and-their-pets/
LOCATION:Mettlesome\, 800 Taylor St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Animals,Art,Causes,Comedy,Fundraiser,Live Performance,Pets
